..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : BROWSER.SET.URL
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : lei
.. Funktion       : Baut die URL forciert aus den Bestandteilen zusammen.
.. Functionality  : Builds URL in a forced was using the elements.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Do nothing because url is already set
.continue END ? _F|empty(M|url)
..
.. Clear url data because there are no informations
.continue CLRURL ? F|empty(F|expr(M|urlscheme + M|urlhost + 'M|urlport' + M|urlpath))
..
.. Build url
.formula M|url = M|urlscheme + "://"       ? _F|empty(M|urlscheme)
.formula M|url = M|url + M|urlhost         ? _F|empty(M|urlhost)
.formula M|url = M|url + ":" + 'M|urlport' ? _F|empty(M|urlport)
.formula M|urlencoded = M|url
.formula M|url = M|url + "/" + M|urlpath   ? _F|empty(M|urlpath)
.formula M|urlencoded = M|urlencoded + "/" + F|urlencode(M|urlpath) ? _F|empty(M|urlpath)
.continue END
..
!CLRURL: Clear URL
.assign M|url = ""
.assign M|urlencoded = ""
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
